  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1e1d4c6f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Key XArray Concepts:**\n",
    "\n",
    "- `data_vars`:These are yor actual measurements (Sea level, temperature, ONI, etc. )\n",
    "- `coords`: These are the \"axes\" of your data. because we named our dimension \"time\", Xarray knows that `ds.sea_level` and `ds.oni` share the same time axis. \n",
    "- `attrs`: short for attributes. This is wehre you can store metadata like \"readme\" info containg sensr info, data collector etc. etc. "
   ]
  },
